I am in the supermarket.
The supermarket is bright and busy.
I take a shopping basket.
The basket is not heavy.
I go straight to the dairy aisle.
I would like cheese.
I like Emmentaler.
I see the Emmentaler.
I take a large piece.
I put the cheese into the basket.
My cupboards at home are empty.
I have no rice and no pasta.
I look for the rice.
I do not find the rice immediately.
The supermarket is very large.
Then I see the rice.
I put the rice and the pasta into the basket.
I also need coffee.
I take the coffee.
Now the basket is heavy.
